OL,3,AVeteran broadcaster Dame Esther Rantzen
OL,4,Adies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Esther Rantzen, who presented BBC
OL,7,Fshow That's Life! for 21 years and
OL,8,Flaunched the charity Childline, has
OL,9,Fdied at the age of 86.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,12,Fveteran broadcaster and campaigner had
OL,13,F"changed countless lives".
OL,15,FDame Esther hosted and produced That's
OL,16,FLife! during its run from 1973 to 1994.
OL,17,FIt regularly attracted 20 million
OL,18,Fviewers for its mixture of serious
OL,19,Fconsumer investigations and
OL,20,Flight-hearted items.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
